{"synopsis":"Setelah melihat pesan spam di ponselku, kukira aku sudah mati tertabrak, tapi ternyata aku berada di kantor tes perasukan saat aku membuka mata. Jadi, aku akan merasuki tokoh di dalam novel? “Apakah ada genre yang anda harapkan?” Aku berharap di kehidupan selanjutnya, aku bisa menjadi anak perempuan yang menerima penuh kasih sayang dalam cerita pengasuhan anak. Tapi… Kenapa aku malah merasuki putri seorang pelayan biasa yang diperlakukan semena-mena oleh keluarga bangsawan tukang onar?!","alternative_title":"빙의자를 위한 특혜","author":"Irinbi","artist":"Grrr","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"627748d9-abe9-4940-86db-f067552ec56b","number":"142","chapter":"142","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"e449350f-d2ea-4a16-b24c-f4b864cd2e5b","number":"141","chapter":"141","title":"","date":"2026-07-26","released":"2026-07-26"},{"chapter_id":"6064bb6d-eb86-4c23-8f59-03e260461ffe","number":"140","chapter":"140","title":"","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22"},{"chapter_id":"49074942-36ca-4388-bef4-6b8618e20486","number":"139","chapter":"139","title":"","date":"2026-07-17","released":"2026-07-17"},{"chapter_id":"097f7412-c5ea-4f73-805e-3ac5827f7ef1","number":"138","chapter":"138","title":"","date":"2026-07-14","released":"2026-07-14"},{"chapter_id":"e0dcf5ee-771a-4adf-92a1-72d1e3cde537","number":"137","chapter":"137","title":"","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11"},{"chapter_id":"a8662e7f-e938-4832-a310-df24929ca4df","number":"136","chapter":"136","title":"","date":"2026-06-22","released":"2026-06-22"},{"chapter_id":"291473e6-9f6c-4407-b33d-e605e37cddf1","number":"135","chapter":"135","title":"","date":"2026-06-17","released":"2026-06-17"},{"chapter_id":"b45f89a5-015b-457a-9f51-843a33d4223d","number":"134","chapter":"134","title":"","date":"2026-06-14","released":"2026-06-14"},{"chapter_id":"3bf6b25d-b92e-4096-9f85-8459c3f2a25e","number":"133","chapter":"133","title":"","date":"2026-06-08","released":"2026-06-08"},{"chapter_id":"